    "name": "Luctus",
    "steam_appid": 2567380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/6da28856547de904e78d93c2b38df839.poster.avif?t=1755086624\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/6da28856547de904e78d93c2b38df839.webm?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/6da28856547de904e78d93c2b38df839.mp4?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luctus is an immersive story-based action-adventure game brought to life with a Pixel Art aesthetic. An in-depth experience filled with memorable characters and a rich universe awaits you. The game blends the dramatic story of our protagonist Nora with action-packed scenes and epic boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/38d66043d7c50b428ea36e55398b0ad2.poster.avif?t=1755086624\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/38d66043d7c50b428ea36e55398b0ad2.webm?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/38d66043d7c50b428ea36e55398b0ad2.mp4?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dramatic Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nora and Luna are two best friends who lost their parents at a young age. After the death of their father, these two young girls, who grew up under one roof, are on the hunt for a creature that caused his death. Nora's story begins when Luna disappears one morning and turns into a profound story of life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/390ddf90ea1d650d98c20f402606e724.poster.avif?t=1755086624\" width=632 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/390ddf90ea1d650d98c20f402606e724.webm?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/390ddf90ea1d650d98c20f402606e724.mp4?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic boss battles are a must in any action game. Get ready for all-new and challenging action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/f8b7b2074ef25aba1d0ba6e2111076b6.poster.avif?t=1755086624\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/f8b7b2074ef25aba1d0ba6e2111076b6.webm?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/f8b7b2074ef25aba1d0ba6e2111076b6.mp4?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fantastic Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luctus will allow you to experience a whole new and unique universe. New races, new realms, new creatures and new gods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/6da28856547de904e78d93c2b38df839.poster.avif?t=1755086624\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/6da28856547de904e78d93c2b38df839.webm?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/6da28856547de904e78d93c2b38df839.mp4?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luctus is an immersive story-based action-adventure game brought to life with a Pixel Art aesthetic. An in-depth experience filled with memorable characters and a rich universe awaits you. The game blends the dramatic story of our protagonist Nora with action-packed scenes and epic boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/38d66043d7c50b428ea36e55398b0ad2.poster.avif?t=1755086624\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/38d66043d7c50b428ea36e55398b0ad2.webm?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/38d66043d7c50b428ea36e55398b0ad2.mp4?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dramatic Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nora and Luna are two best friends who lost their parents at a young age. After the death of their father, these two young girls, who grew up under one roof, are on the hunt for a creature that caused his death. Nora's story begins when Luna disappears one morning and turns into a profound story of life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/390ddf90ea1d650d98c20f402606e724.poster.avif?t=1755086624\" width=632 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/390ddf90ea1d650d98c20f402606e724.webm?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/390ddf90ea1d650d98c20f402606e724.mp4?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic boss battles are a must in any action game. Get ready for all-new and challenging action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/f8b7b2074ef25aba1d0ba6e2111076b6.poster.avif?t=1755086624\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/f8b7b2074ef25aba1d0ba6e2111076b6.webm?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567380/extras/f8b7b2074ef25aba1d0ba6e2111076b6.mp4?t=1755086624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fantastic Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luctus will allow you to experience a whole new and unique universe. New races, new realms, new creatures and new gods!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In this RPG-inspired action-adventure, you play as Nora, a fire mage. Discover epic creatures steeped in mythology and turn them to ash with powerful spells! Teach Nora new magic, upgrade your favorites, and craft unique combos. Can you bring an end to Nora\u2019s sorrow?",
